me":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165010290,"discussion_id":"a0562488680650ee0fab16f6c83161f517362d51","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-12T10:40:22+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-12T10:40:22+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165010337,"discussion_id":"90f09f337b83b1ac42420ca25f2cfa26be7c1fd6","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-03-12T10:40:37+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-12T10:40:37+08:00","user":{"id":"67c01c9b1a95a5378f573eea","login":"liangyuhua","object_id":"67c01c9b1a95a5378f573eea","name":"liangyuhua","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fc/af/9853f2c3af384f598f137dac3afddba45d3768ca771b4cd7bc1b552e9560ff82.jpg","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/liangyuhua"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165010359,"discussion_id":"75939a3c41964cbe8f13699438af0216af7356e8","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复量化算子中针对 `int8_t` 输出类型的存储逻辑问题。原代码在将中间浮点结果转换为 `int8_t` 时，转换路径存在冗余且可能导致不必要的精度损失，影响最终量化结果的准确性。本次修改旨在通过优化转换流程，提高量化精度和计算效率。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n优化了 `StoreTensorForDtypeTOut` 模板函数中处理 `T_OUT` 为 `int8_t` 类型时的逻辑。核心修改是：在将 `float` 转换为 `half` 并最终转换为 `int8_t` 之前，先插入一个从 `float` 到 `int32_t` 的舍入转换，再转换回 `float`，以模拟定点舍入操作，减少直接转换引入的精度误差。同时，将最终 `Cast` 调用的目标类型从硬编码的 `int8_t` 改为模板参数 `T_OUT`，提高了代码的通用性。","created_at":"2026-03-12T10:40:46+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-12T10:40:46+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url